cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MRIQC, please cite the article given as the preferred citation below."
type: software
title: "MRIQC: Advancing the automatic prediction of image quality in MRI from unseen sites"
abstract: >-
  MRIQC extracts no-reference IQMs (image quality metrics) from structural
  (T1w, T2w and FLAIR), functional and diffusion MRI (magnetic resonance imaging) data,
  and generates visual reports for the quality assessment of each image.
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/nipreps/mriqc"
url: "https://mriqc.readthedocs.io/"
keywords:
  - neuroimaging
  - workflow
  - pipeline
  - quality-control
  - fMRI
  - BIDS
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.2630889
    description: "Concept DOI for all MRIQC releases on Zenodo"

